== #ez_caption[Further Reading][延伸阅读]

#parec[
  Donald Knuth's article _Literate Programming_ (@Knuth1984) describes the main ideas behind literate programming as well as his `web` programming environment. The seminal T#sub[E]X typesetting system was written with `web` and has been published as a series of books (@Knuth1986; @Knuth1993a). Knuth and Levy presented the implementation of the `cweb` literate programming system as a literate program (@Knuth1994). Knuth has also published both a collection of graph algorithms in _The Stanford GraphBase_ (@Knuth1993b) and a simulator for the _MMIX_ instruction set (@Knuth1999) in literate format. These programs are enjoyable to read and are excellent presentations of their respective algorithms. The website #link("http://www.literateprogramming.com/")[www.literateprogramming.com] has pointers to many articles about literate programming, literate programs to download, and a variety of literate programming systems; many refinements have been made since Knuth's original development of the idea.
][
  Donald Knuth 的文章《文学编程》（@Knuth1984）介绍了文学编程的主要思想及其 `web` 编程环境。开创性的 T#sub[E]X 排版系统用 `web` 编写，并以一系列书籍的形式出版（@Knuth1986；@Knuth1993a）。Knuth 和 Levy 也以文学程序的形式介绍了 `cweb` 文学编程系统的实现（@Knuth1994）。Knuth 还采用文学编程形式出版了《The Stanford GraphBase》中的一组图算法（@Knuth1993b），以及 _MMIX_ 指令集模拟器（@Knuth1999）。这些程序读来令人愉快，也是各自算法的优秀讲解。网站 #link("http://www.literateprogramming.com/")[www.literateprogramming.com] 提供了许多文学编程文章的链接、可下载的文学程序，以及各种文学编程系统；自 Knuth 最初提出这一思想以来，它已得到许多改进。
]

#parec[
  Other literate programs we know of that have been published as books include one on the implementation of the `lcc` compiler, which was written by Christopher Fraser and David Hanson and published as _A Retargetable C Compiler: Design and Implementation_ (@Fraser95). See also Hanson's book on program interface design (@Hanson96), Mehlhorn and Näher's presentation on the implementation of the LEDA library (@Mehlhorn99), Valiente's collection of graph algorithms (@Valiente02), and Ruckert's description of the _mp3_ audio format (@Ruckert05).
][
  我们所知的其他以书籍形式出版的文学程序，还包括 Christopher Fraser 和 David Hanson 编写的 `lcc` 编译器实现，以《可重定目标的 C 编译器：设计与实现》出版（@Fraser95）。另可参阅 Hanson 关于程序接口设计的著作（@Hanson96）、Mehlhorn 和 Näher 对 LEDA 库实现的介绍（@Mehlhorn99）、Valiente 的图算法集（@Valiente02），以及 Ruckert 对 _mp3_ 音频格式的讲解（@Ruckert05）。
]
